# Ruflo local secrets and runtime data
.env.local
.env.*.local

# Agent tooling. Kept out of version control on purpose: ruflo scaffolds ~250
# files of agents, skills, and runtime state. It still runs from disk, but this
# repo is part of the Shipaton submission and judges read it for code quality,
# so the tooling must not bury src/, content/, and app/.
.claude-flow/
.claude/
.agents/
.swarm/
ruvector.db
# Same reasoning, one level up: .mcp.json is the ruflo MCP server definition and
# nothing in the app reads it. It was the last piece of agent tooling still
# tracked, in a repo whose own rule two comments above is that the tooling stays
# out of the submission. Untracked 2026-09-18; the file stays on disk and is
# regenerated by the tool, so nobody's local setup breaks.
.mcp.json

# Ruflo's AgentDB drops these two in the REPO ROOT rather than under .swarm/,
# so the directory rules above miss them entirely.
agentdb.rvf
agentdb.rvf.lock
*.db
*.db-shm
*.db-wal

# Test coverage output
coverage/
